      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Alveolar osteitis (AO) is the most common postoperative complication following a tooth extraction. This article focuses on its etiology and contributing factors. It is intended to assist the general practitioner in reducing the incidence of AO in his or her practice. The article includes summaries of current preventive and treatment measures."},
